From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] winemetal: find madeira_cfg.h beside the fork

winemetal_unix.c expects the fork at <Madeira>/research/dxmt. The build
root places Madeira's build/ beside the fork, as it already does for
remote-metal/.

Class: linux-build
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-24-bootstrap.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/winemetal/unix/winemetal_unix.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/src/winemetal/unix/winemetal_unix.c b/src/winemetal/unix/winemetal_unix.c
index 731eacd..eb79842 100644
--- a/src/winemetal/unix/winemetal_unix.c
+++ b/src/winemetal/unix/winemetal_unix.c
@@ -1,5 +1,5 @@
 #include <stdatomic.h>
-#include "../../../../../build/madeira_cfg.h"   /* ml1095: one config file */
+#include "../../../../build/madeira_cfg.h"   /* ml1095: one config file; Playport: build/ is a sibling of the fork, as remote-metal is */
 #include <pthread.h>
 #include <time.h>
 #include <unistd.h>
